OL,3,GNEWSAPlans to redevelop national
OL,4,Asnooker venue approved
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillors have approved a #25m plan
OL,7,Fto redevelop the home of snooker's
OL,8,FEnglish Open.
OL,10,FThe Brentwood Centre, which is also
OL,11,Fhome to a gym and two swimming pools,
OL,12,Fhas hosted the annual competition since
OL,13,F2022.
OL,15,FHowever, the venue has been described
OL,16,Fas needing "a bit of TLC" by sports
OL,17,Fpromoter Barry Hearn, whose business is
OL,18,Fbased in the Essex town.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
