OL,3,GNEWSAPlans to redevelop national
OL,4,Asnooker venue approved
OL,5,
OL,6,FGareth Barrett, chairman of Brentwood
OL,7,FBorough Council's asset and strategy
OL,8,Fcommittee, said it was "a huge moment"
OL,9,Ffor the area.
